App icon and web UI favicon
---------------------------

packaging/AppIcon.svg, packaging/AppIcon.icns and
crates/fotw-web/ui/favicon.svg are derived from "Fly" by Delapouite,
https://game-icons.net/1x1/delapouite/fly.html, licensed under CC BY 3.0,
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/. The CC BY 3.0 terms, not the
Apache License, apply to the original artwork.

Changes from the original: the fly is recolored green (#0cd420).
AppIcon.svg sets it on a dark rounded-square tile (#171A2B), and
AppIcon.icns is rendered from AppIcon.svg. favicon.svg has no background.
The outline is not redrawn: its path is the copy in Iconify's game-icons
set, which encodes the original path more compactly and rounds some values
but keeps every segment's end point.

Third-party software
--------------------

No third-party source code is vendored in this repository. The fotwd binary
in FlyOnTheWall.app statically links Rust crates and the C libraries that
some of them compile from source (SQLCipher, SQLite, OpenSSL, libopus).
Their copyright notices and license texts are in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md,
which `just bundle` copies into the app's Contents/Resources directory.
